<DocsLayout title="Platform (Web UI)" activeNav="/platform">
  <h1>Platform</h1>
  <p>
    The web console is where you set a team up: applications and their identifiers, signing
    material, CI/CD connections, and who on the team can touch what. Once that exists, day-to-day
    automation usually happens through the <a href="/guides/cli">CLI</a> or the
    <a href="/api-reference">API</a> — but a few things live only here, and this section says
    which.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every screenshot on these pages is captured from a running instance by
    <code>apps/docs/scripts/capture-ui-screenshots.mjs</code>, so what you see is the current
    interface rather than a drawing of it.
  </p>

  <Screenshot
    src="applications"
    alt="The Applications screen listing four applications with their tags, identifier counts and last update"
    caption="Applications is the landing screen for a workspace."
  />

  <h2>How the console is organised</h2>
  <p>
    Everything is scoped to a <strong>workspace</strong> — the switcher at the top of the sidebar.
    A workspace is a team: its own applications, credentials, integrations, API keys, and audit
    trail. Nothing is shared between workspaces, and an API key belongs to exactly one.
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Sidebar entry</th><th>What it holds</th><th>Page</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Applications</td>
        <td>Apps, per-platform identifiers, files and assets, build history</td>
        <td><a href="/platform/applications">Applications</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Credentials Vault</td>
        <td>Keystores, certificates, service accounts, and their expiry state</td>
        <td><a href="/platform/credentials-vault">Credentials Vault</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>API keys</td>
        <td>Team-bound keys for CI and integrations, with per-scope grants</td>
        <td><a href="/platform/api-keys">API keys</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Audit log</td>
        <td>Who changed what, from which source, with before and after values</td>
        <td><a href="/platform/audit-log">Audit log</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Integrations</td>
        <td>CI/CD providers, Expo accounts, webhook endpoints, chat notifications</td>
        <td><a href="/platform/integrations">Integrations</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Team access</td>
        <td>Members, roles, and pending invitations</td>
